{"suttaId":"tha-ap477","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1693,1707],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap477:0.3":"Kummāsadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap477:1.1":"“Esanāya carantassa, vipassissa mahesino;","tha-ap477:1.3":"Rittakaṃ pattaṃ disvāna, kummāsaṃ pūrayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap477:2.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ bhikkhaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap477:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kummāsassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap477:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap477:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap477:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap477:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kummāsadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap477:7.1":"Kummāsadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
